title: Greenwashing
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Making a thing sound better for the planet than it is.

It doesn't have to be a lie. "Recyclable" on a [[Tetra Pak]] carton is true. It leaves out that only about one carton in five gets recycled, and that the plastic and foil mostly don't.

A claim can be accurate and still mislead.

See [[Recyclable, but really?]], [[Downcycling]]
